id.instance: String (TS "c<n>")
num.game: i32
num.cursor: u32
map.ordered: IndexMap
bag.data: IndexMap<String, serde_json::Value>
error.style: Result<_, EngineError> with TS's message; panic only on invariants (server CLIs: anyhow::Result with TS's message text)
null.optional: Option + skip_serializing_if
null.nullable: Option, serialised null
case.json: camelCase via serde rename_all
case.rust: snake_case
state.mut: &mut GameState writes, &GameState reads, &mut EngineSink for TS sink mutators
rng.source: Rng::new(&state.seed, state.rng_cursor) and write the cursor back
hook.style: Arc<dyn Fn + Send + Sync> via hook(); no fn pointers, no Box
registry.style: OnceLock set once by register_all; fused scripts built on lookup from state
async.style: tokio in crates/server only; none in pure crates
log.style: tracing JSON to stdout, server only (CLI result lines stay plain println/eprintln, as TS's process.stdout/stderr writes)
store.call: one store call outside store.tx = Db::begin(subject) + the Tx method + commit (once! in the tests)
store.args: &str, &Row, &[T], Option<&str>, unions by value, integers i64 (store.rs, chunk 4)
store.rows: built from TS's JSON with serde_json::from_value, read back with serde_json::to_value
sql.binds: TS's SQL verbatim; ids bound as uuid::Uuid where pg inferred uuid from the column
catalog.version: jackioh_cards::catalog_version(); CATALOG_VERSION env must equal it when set
